        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion R3, Sonoma Full Plate Handleset With Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Two-Piece Sonoma Handleset Pull features a thick squared handle and matching brackets for the rustic, Northern Italy appearance that has become the trademark style of the Sonoma wine country. It is made out of solid bronze and is available in a antique pewter, medium bronze or oil rubbed bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sonoma Solid Brass Handleset Fusion R3\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Sonoma Door Entry Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 16-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sonoma Two Piece Handleset, Fusion R3",
                "description": "Two Piece Sonoma Handleset Fusion R3 - Fusion Hardware's Two-Piece Sonoma Handleset Pull features a thick squared handle and matching brackets for the rustic, Northern Italy appearance that has become the trademark style of the Sonoma wine country. It is made out of solid bronze and is available in a antique pewter, medium bronze or oil rubbed bronze finish.\r\n",
